Revision history for Restish-Client

1.10    2026-10-02
        - Add PUT shortcut method
        - thin_request: remove redundant empty-body handling for POST, report
          the invalid method in errors, and stop warning when a response has
          no Content-Type
        - Rewrite the documentation: fix the broken thin_request examples,
          reorder sections, and document return values, errors and subclassing
        - Regenerate README.md from the POD
        - Fix license metadata: the distribution is GPL v3 (matching LICENSE),
          not Apache 2.0
        - Add tests for the method shortcuts and thin_request

1.0     2025-12-04
        - Initial CPAN release
        - Basic REST client functionality with Moo-based interface
        - Support for GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, PATCH, LIST methods
        - URI templating with Text::Sprintf::Named
        - Query and body parameter handling
        - Custom header support with defaults
        - SSL/TLS options support
        - Cookie jar support (in-memory and persistent)
        - Response code, header, and body accessors
        - Debug mode with token trimming
        - Raw body upload support for files
        - Thin request interface for direct LWP access
        - Comprehensive test suite
